<monstergroup>    
  <monstergroupinfo>
    <monstergrouptitle>Lycans</monstergrouptitle>
    <monstergroupid>lycans</monstergroupid>
    <monstergroupdescription>
      <p>
	Lycans suffer from a disease, a disease of the soul.
	They are possessed, but the curse of the lycan is
	no normal possession.  Lycanthropy is the symptom of
	possession by an animalistic blood spirits.
      </p>

      <p>
	Lycans regenerate against normal damage.  They are
	immune to damage other than from fire, crushing damage,
	or silver weapons.
      </p>
    </monstergroupdescription>
  </monstergroupinfo>

  
